         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_15636d68-db52-bda5-e063-6394a90acd55">
               <id root="15d96b80-1e30-02ac-e063-6294a90abf09"/>
               <code code="50565-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN SECTION"/>
               <title>Keep out of reach of children.</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Overdose warning:</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>In case of overdose, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away. (1-800-222-1222) Prompt medical attention is critical even if you do not notice any signs or symptoms.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20240219"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_1563b887-495e-c929-e063-6394a90a28fb">
               <id root="15d97433-d14f-172e-e063-6294a90abc9c"/>
               <code code="55105-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - PURPOSE SECTION"/>
               <title>Purpose: </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Pain reliever/fever reducer
  <br/>
                     <br/>
Uses temporarily:
  <br/>
▪ reduces fever
  <br/>
▪ relieves minor aches and pains due to:
  <br/>
▪ the common cold
  <br/>
▪ flu
  <br/>
▪ headache
  <br/>
▪ sore throat
  <br/>
▪ toothache
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20240219"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_1563c892-3142-0a41-e063-6294a90a2e62">
               <id root="15d9a269-6a33-ab14-e063-6394a90a457d"/>
               <code code="50566-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - STOP USE SECTION"/>
               <title>Stop use and ask a doctor.</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Stop use and ask a doctor if:
  <br/>
▪ pain gets worse or lasts more than 5 days
  <br/>
▪ fever gets worse or lasts more than 3 days
  <br/>
▪ redness or swelling is present
  <br/>
▪ any new symptoms appear
  <br/>
These could be signs of a serious condition.
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20240219"/>
            </section>
         </component>
